abstract: >-
  Assessment and evaluation code, operational esSROI criteria, aggregated
  criterion-level results, and scripts for regenerating manuscript tables and
  numerical figures. Confidential business plans and record-level assessments
  are excluded. This prepared snapshot has not yet been assigned an archive DOI.
